#: src/features/settings/channels/email/EmailFields.tsx
msgid "If your Amazon SES account uses tenants, name the tenant this channel’s mail belongs to. Yuva adds it as X-SES-TENANT; the tenant must have this sending domain and the configuration set."
msgstr "ଯଦି ଆପଣଙ୍କ Amazon SES ଖାତା ଟେନାଣ୍ଟ ବ୍ୟବହାର କରେ, ଏହି ଚ୍ୟାନେଲର ମେଲ୍ ଯେଉଁ ଟେନାଣ୍ଟର ତାହାର ନାମ ଦିଅନ୍ତୁ। Yuva ଏହାକୁ X-SES-TENANT ଭାବେ ଯୋଡ଼େ; ଟେନାଣ୍ଟରେ ଏହି ପଠାଇବା ଡୋମେନ୍ ଓ କନଫିଗରେସନ୍ ସେଟ୍ ଥିବା ଜରୁରୀ।"

#: src/features/settings/channels/email/Deliverability.tsx
msgid "If your DNS provider limits a TXT string to 255 characters, split the value into several strings of one record."
